<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text">
 <office:automatic-styles>
  <style:style style:name="B" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold"/></style:style>
  <style:style style:name="I" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-style="italic"/></style:style>
  <text:list-style style:name="L1"><text:list-level-style-bullet text:level="1" text:bullet-char="•"/></text:list-style>
 </office:automatic-styles>
 <office:body>
  <office:text>
   <text:tracked-changes text:track-changes="true"></text:tracked-changes>
   <text:h text:outline-level="1">Heavy on comments</text:h>
   <text:p>The buyer may <text:span text:style-name="B">inspect</text:span> the<office:annotation office:name="c1"><dc:creator>Dev Patel</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:07:00</dc:date><text:p>Why thirty and not sixty?</text:p></office:annotation> goods before accepting<office:annotation-end office:name="c1"/> them.<office:annotation><dc:creator>Dev Patel</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:14:00</dc:date><text:p>Check the defined term.</text:p></office:annotation></text:p>
   <text:p><office:annotation office:name="c2"><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:21:00</dc:date><text:p>Agreed.</text:p></office:annotation>Either party may<office:annotation-end office:name="c2"/> end this agreement with ninety days written <text:span text:style-name="B">notice</text:span>.<office:annotation office:name="c3"><dc:creator>Bo Chen</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:28:00</dc:date><text:p>Legal to review.</text:p></office:annotation></text:p>
   <text:p><office:annotation-end office:name="c3"/>The price <text:span text:style-name="B">includes</text:span> packaging but <text:span text:style-name="B">excludes</text:span> shipping and taxes.</text:p>
   <text:p>Disputes go first to mediation and<office:annotation office:name="c4"><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:35:00</dc:date><text:p>Please confirm with finance.</text:p></office:annotation> then to<office:annotation-end office:name="c4"/> the courts of Manhattan.<office:annotation><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:42:00</dc:date><text:p>Please confirm with finance.</text:p></office:annotation><office:annotation office:name="c5"><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:49:00</dc:date><text:p>Agreed.</text:p></office:annotation></text:p>
   <text:p><office:annotation-end office:name="c5"/>The supplier keeps title to the goods<office:annotation office:name="c6"><dc:creator>Dev Patel</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T00:56:00</dc:date><text:p>Why thirty and not sixty?</text:p></office:annotation> <text:span text:style-name="I">until</text:span> they<office:annotation-end office:name="c6"/> are paid in <text:span text:style-name="I">full</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p>Each party<office:annotation office:name="c7"><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:03:00</dc:date><text:p>Please confirm with finance.</text:p></office:annotation> keeps the other party's<office:annotation-end office:name="c7"/> confidential information secret.</text:p>
   <text:p>Notices must be sent by email and<office:annotation office:name="c8"><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:10:00</dc:date><text:p>Why thirty and not sixty?</text:p></office:annotation> by registered<office:annotation-end office:name="c8"/> mail.</text:p>
   <text:p>Each party keeps<office:annotation office:name="c9"><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:17:00</dc:date><text:p>Why thirty and not sixty?</text:p></office:annotation> the<office:annotation-end office:name="c9"/> other party's confidential information secret.</text:p>
   <text:p>Neither party is liable for delays<office:annotation office:name="c10"><dc:creator>Dev Patel</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:24:00</dc:date><text:p>Agreed.</text:p></office:annotation> caused<office:annotation-end office:name="c10"/> <text:span text:style-name="B">by</text:span> events beyond its control.</text:p>
   <text:p>The<office:annotation office:name="c11"><dc:creator>Carla Duarte</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:31:00</dc:date><text:p>Agreed.</text:p></office:annotation> <text:span text:style-name="B">warranty</text:span> period<office:annotation-end office:name="c11"/> <text:span text:style-name="I">is</text:span> twelve months from delivery.</text:p>
   <text:p>The buyer may inspect the goods<office:annotation office:name="c12"><dc:creator>Bo Chen</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:38:00</dc:date><text:p>Why thirty and not sixty?</text:p></office:annotation> before<office:annotation-end office:name="c12"/> accepting them.</text:p>
   <text:p>This agreement is governed by the laws<office:annotation office:name="c13"><dc:creator>Dev Patel</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:45:00</dc:date><text:p>Please confirm with finance.</text:p></office:annotation> of<office:annotation-end office:name="c13"/> the <text:span text:style-name="I">State</text:span> of New York.<office:annotation office:name="c14"><dc:creator>Ana Lima</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:52:00</dc:date><text:p>Too broad, narrow it down.</text:p></office:annotation></text:p>
   <text:p><office:annotation-end office:name="c14"/>The<office:annotation office:name="c15"><dc:creator>Dev Patel</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T01:59:00</dc:date><text:p>Why thirty and not sixty?</text:p></office:annotation> warranty period is <text:span text:style-name="B">twelve</text:span><office:annotation-end office:name="c15"/> <text:span text:style-name="I">months</text:span> from delivery.</text:p>
   <text:p>Payment is due on receipt of a<office:annotation office:name="c16"><dc:creator>Bo Chen</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-09-01T02:06:00</dc:date><text:p>Agreed.</text:p></office:annotation> correct<office:annotation-end office:name="c16"/> invoice.</text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
</office:document>
